-03.","cites":["SNDK.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","SNDK.d.revenue.2025-06-28.2025-10-03"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Over the four quarters to 2026-10-02 revenue added up to $29 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $21 billion and net income to $19.4 billion.","cites":["SNDK.d.revenue.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","SNDK.d.revenue.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","SNDK.d.revenue.2025-06-28.2026-07-03","SNDK.d.revenue.2025-06-28.2026-04-03","SNDK.d.revenue.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","SNDK.d.opinc.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","SNDK.d.opinc.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","SNDK.d.opinc.2025-06-28.2026-07-03","SNDK.d.opinc.2025-06-28.2026-04-03","SNDK.d.opinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","SNDK.d.netinc.2025-10-04.2026-01-02","SNDK.d.netinc.2026-01-03.2026-04-03","SNDK.d.netinc.2025-06-28.2026-07-03","SNDK.d.netinc.2025-06-28.2026-04-03","SNDK.d.netinc.2026-07-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $17.4 billion: operating cash flow of $17.5 billion less capital spending of $181 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["SNDK.d.ocf.2025-06-28.2026-01-02","SNDK.d.ocf.2025-06-28.2025-10-03","SNDK.d.ocf.2025-06-28.2026-04-03","SNDK.d.ocf.2025-06-28.2026-07-03","SNDK.d.ocf.2026-07-04.2026-10-02","SNDK.d.capex.2025-06-28.2026-01-02","SNDK.d.capex.2025-06-28.2025-10-03","SNDK.d.capex.2025-06-28.2026-04-03","SNDK.d.capex.2025-06-28.2026-07-03","SNDK.d.capex.2026-07-04.2026-10-02"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-10-06 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2026 as $10.5 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $2.7 billion.","cites":["SNDK.pay.peoTotal.2026","SNDK.pay.peoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $3.4 million in total and $566 million actually paid.","cites":["SNDK.pay.neoTotal.2026","SNDK.pay.neoPaid.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $59.8 billion at the end of FY2026. That is 295.3% of FY2026 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["SNDK.rpo.2026","SNDK.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.2 billion at the end of FY2026 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $25 million a year earlier.","cites":["SNDK.deferred.2026","SNDK.deferred.2025"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 11,100 in its own words. FY2026 revenue works out to about $1.8 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["SNDK.q.employees","SNDK.revenue.2026"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2026 the balance sheet carried $4.8 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $0 of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + LongTermDebtCurrent). Cash exceeded that debt by $4.8 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["SNDK.cash.2026","SNDK.debtLong.2026","SNDK.debtCurrent.2026"]}]},"fin":{"SNDK":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":72,"read":72,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Shek Bernard","Chief Legal Officer and Secty"],["Goeckeler David","Chairman & CEO, director"],["Visoso Luis Felipe","EVP & CFO"],["Shek Bernard","Chief Legal Officer & Secty"],["Ilkbahar Alper","EVP & Chief Technology Officer"],["Ilkbahar Alper","EVP, Chief Technology Officer"],["Pokorny Michael","VP, Chief Accounting Officer"],["Sayiner Necip","Director"],["Suzuki Miyuki","Director"]],"rows":[["S",0,600,694956,"2026-11-02","2026-11-02","0001242648-26-000049","2026-11-03",1],["S",0,600,1040964,"2026-10-01","2026-10-01","0001242648-26-000045","2026-10-02",1],["S",1,33841,53272704.27,"2026-09-17","2026-09-17","0001242648-26-000041","2026-09-21",1],["S",2,1000,1568830,"2026-09-15","2026-09-15","0001242648-26-000033","2026-09-16",1],["S",1,33838,51700