— 74% in Asia Pacific, 19% in the Americas, and 7% in Europe, the Middle East, and Africa.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"5eb9ab58e7f3a3c46aba2dfaceed18893e5fe87fe869d19f249334bf7b2c5f37"},"SNDK.q.risk.0":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"Our operating results may fluctuate due to changes in demand, industry cycles and the timing of customer deployments, including AI-related data center investments, and our ability to accurately forecast demand as a result of these changing market conditions.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"9bfa1e54b988fb66fdc1dd5422c755887cc7866d837293b7141fd0d417cab37e"},"SNDK.q.risk.1":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"Long-term agreements, which we also refer to as New Business Models or “NBMs”, expose us to certain execution, financial, and market risks, which could be significant.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"932cd4b61cfd7e5159a7717f6957ed1c75e301a6e550c230e3cb2936c8f702d1"},"SNDK.q.risk.2":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"Our guarantees of certain obligations of Flash Ventures could negatively impact our financial position, and the loan agreement governing our revolving credit facility contains various covenants and restrictions that may restrict our operations and ability to respond to future business opportunities.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"0466fb258b50a45dd549f4f92f6ad45e520ebc78afacb7953b5eaa32ac7da48b"},"SNDK.q.risk.3":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"The amount and timing of our share repurchases may fluctuate, and share repurchases may not enhance shareholder value and could affect the price of our common stock and reduce our financial flexibility.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"0e405de55f500f2898ac07e5c6579709039f7e1ac7cf2fe4bc333c1e1ca1982f"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.0":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If we are required to make payments pursuant to our indemnities to WDC in connection with the spin-off, our financial results could be adversely impacted.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"eca988a3f12a9b6c7eba6fc8ec926fa89c452f107f4c0b5403cc94aeee7592da"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.1":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Sales in the distribution channel and to the retail market are important to our business, and if we fail to respond to demand changes within these markets, or maintain and grow our applicable market share, our business could suffer.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"b8080c5c2e5466e95629e6271c283e099d63ffe60ae3296f39586618a41e9b23"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.2":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Our level of debt may negatively impact our liquidity, restrict our operations and ability to respond to business opportunities and increase our vulnerability to adverse economic and industry conditions.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"a182479ea6af567673e3c3804d2c16a635aea824972a0a3cd5295b09d03915a7"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.3":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Future material impairments in the value of our goodwill, intangible assets and other long-lived assets would negatively affect our operating results.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"a0579dc7cb05e705811ff4b6fde8db2b964d7f12a53dca8f4c7b9dbbd7d0b584"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.4":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We may not achieve some or all of the expected benefits of the spin-off, and the spin-off may adversely impact our business.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"13028925c1f603f6e7db9fd3951af7797f57dd675c713d1fb1d3fa0fcd29a43a"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.5":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We have incurred and expect to continue to incur ongoing material costs and expenses as a result of the spin-off.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"22d2cbf439876e8bba9c9eb89a973d76f2e09891361e6fdeaaa18cca37b094e4"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.6":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"WDC may fail to perform under various transaction agreements that were executed as part of the spin-off, or we may fail to have necessary systems and services in place when WDC is no longer obligated to provide services under the various agreements.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"af9ff34a183c3253a2b78777fae761e293d28531afdc653f54e3d1d0382524c5"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.7":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The spin-off and related internal restructuring transactions may expose us to potential liabilities arising out of state and federal fraudulent conveyance laws and legal dividend requirements.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"33614d520a1a6d9d1ef8718265f3223c72c7474d0bdf5620fd7001b725e01313"},"SNDK.q.riskgone.8":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Some of our officers and directors currently hold or previously held positions with WDC and may still hold equity in WDC, which may give rise to actual or potential conflicts of interest.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"4be842a22775e21c0af835ed4cbf1365dcf1bb7c024bfb092581d63e0c8eadfb"},"SNDK.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"Failure to properly manage technology transitions and product development and introduction could harm our competitiveness and operating results.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"01a633a8ba371a7721c0c8763df4a81d20cb97945d7858b652b557cca6db3de0"},"SNDK.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If we do not properly manage technology transitions and product development and introduction, our competitiveness and operating results may be negatively affected.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"3a180688451e89a8ef22f152f35eea618504d7bf7aae7024f5c00a17b7354ff9"},"SNDK.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"We may be unable to implement, on a timely or cost-effective basis, the systems, internal controls, and governance structures necessary to operate effectively as an independent company.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"fdd6533eed71df3f3a0f3501e381447b9aaf9dccf674b4e6e6d705e4eebb6f62"},"SNDK.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We may be unable to implement, on a timely or cost-effective basis, the changes necessary to operate as an independent company.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"991142964bd85f5d1792d6c0508b3be5a8994787c67ab72c1fad359b16aa8001"},"SNDK.q.riskrw.2":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"We participate in a highly competitive industry that has been, and may continue to be, subject to declining average selling prices, volatile demand, rapid technological change and industry consolidation, as well as lengthy product qualifications, all of which can negatively impact our business.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"cee07149670117fe4439dd52dee408c0f37faead6de3ae858840f993346d331e"},"SNDK.q.riskrwwas.2":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We participate in a highly competitive industry that is often subject to declining average selling prices, volatile demand, rapid technological change and industry consolidation, as well as lengthy product qualifications, all of which can negatively impact our business.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"f6dac511000d828543b07340d7c576eab56101ff820002de016dcc0cb5b84412"},"SNDK.q.riskrw.3":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"Our aspirations, disclosures and actions related to sustainability and governance matters expose us to risks that could adversely affect our reputation and performance.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"58d2194593a872ced9c40b1542c81fc9b9159eaf49968a8ee433e1419f2f7b7b"},"SNDK.q.riskrwwas.3":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Our aspirations, disclosures and actions related to environmental, social and governance matters expose us to risks that could adversely affect our reputation and performance.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"399459a2165804c52df35b237f48cec5d676d46ce385ac76751786e6d75a98f4"},"SNDK.q.riskrw.4":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"We experience cybersecurity incidents of varying degrees on our technology infrastructure and systems and, as a result, unauthorized parties may obtain access to our computer systems and networks, including cloud-based platforms.","source":"SNDK-0001628280-26-057406","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-08-17","proof":"58660d1b8d9bba41c26a4b97fd5edcad208be3ff1033a67ba17128f9874f4e27"},"SNDK.q.riskrwwas.4":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk-was","quote":"We experience cyber incidents of varying degrees on our technology infrastructure and systems and, as a result, unauthorized parties may obtain access to our computer systems and networks, including cloud-based platforms.","source":"SNDK-0002023554-25-000034","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-08-21","proof":"dfdbd95422353ead00168ba43bae661e4d1e0d5416c16fd9136fd5130a194dc4"},"SNDK.q.riskrw.5":{"c":"SNDK","kind":"risk","quote":"We are subject to laws, rules and regulations relating to the collection, use, transfer, sharing and security of data, including personal data, and our failure to comply with these laws, rules and regulati